&HEAD CHID='HK-FIRE', TITLE='Hong Fu Court V8 staged facade-interior runaway scenario' /

! V7 LOGIC
! - Each building has its own independent timeline.
! - Incoming shed/covered-area fire -> receiving facade -> front room -> deeper room.
! - Fires are deliberately staggered; they do NOT ignite simultaneously.
! - Vertical growth proceeds story by story while existing lower fires remain active.
! - Central courtyard fire points are all placed on actual central covered-area OBSTs.
! - No SPREAD_RATE and no material pyrolysis.
! - The prescribed ignition timeline is scaled to a 720 s demonstration run.
! - Delayed events represent exposure from the preceding room, facade, or neighboring building.
! - The event order is prescribed for a controlled demonstration; it is not an automatic
!   ignition criterion or a validated prediction of a real building fire.
! - RAMP factors are rounded to one decimal place; event timing remains at 0.1 s resolution.

! One MESH per MPI rank/GPU. Launch this input on one node with mpirun -np 4.
! The 2 x 2 split keeps every MESH at the same 0.5 m resolution and cell count.
&MESH ID='M1', IJK=180,150,240, XB=0.,90.,0.,75.,0.,120., MPI_PROCESS=0 /
&MESH ID='M2', IJK=180,150,240, XB=90.,180.,0.,75.,0.,120., MPI_PROCESS=1 /
&MESH ID='M3', IJK=180,150,240, XB=0.,90.,75.,150.,0.,120., MPI_PROCESS=2 /
&MESH ID='M4', IJK=180,150,240, XB=90.,180.,75.,150.,0.,120., MPI_PROCESS=3 /
! Total nominal cells = 25,920,000
&TIME T_END=720. /
&MISC TMPA=25. /
&DUMP DT_HRR=2., DT_DEVC=10., DT_SMOKE3D=5., DT_SLCF=5. /
&REAC FUEL='PROPANE', SOOT_YIELD=0.06, CO_YIELD=0.01 /

&SURF ID='FIRE_EV_001', HRRPUA=1000., RAMP_Q='RAMP_EV_001', COLOR='ORANGE' /
&SURF ID='FIRE_EV_002', HRRPUA=1000., RAMP_Q='RAMP_EV_002', COLOR='ORANGE' /
&SURF ID='FIRE_EV_003', HRRPUA=1000., RAMP_Q='RAMP_EV_003', COLOR='ORANGE' /
