! ================= OUTPUT =================
! Full-domain scalar slices. Smokeview joins the four mesh pieces for each plane.
! Three representative X planes and three representative Y planes are retained.
! Center-adjacent planes avoid placing a slice exactly on the mesh interface.
! X planes: west building group, center, and east building group.
&SLCF ID='PANORAMA_VELOCITY_X030_WEST', PBX=30., QUANTITY='VELOCITY' /
